{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34457","headline":"和袭美寄广文先生 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美寄广文先生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽辞明主事真君，直取姜巴路入云。\n龙篆拜时轻诰命，霓襟披後小玄纁。\n峰前北帝三元会，石上东卿九锡文。\n应笑世间名利火，等闲灵府剩先焚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34457.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34457","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}